## Purpose

Close the post-merge producer/consumer gap between the exact governance Release output and the exact Ops package receipt consumer.

## Exact merged identities

```text
governance commit  6b20ba62e5b84de7549cc1df801af453dec03a38
governance tree    aae076151f4c3b0758619c3e6202797ee04ab2b6
