{"body":"## Purpose

Connect the existing core-port JSONL parser/reducer/projector to the accepted Artifact Runtime and AtlasStage catalog so Base, Graph, semantic Map and Seq differ only by checked-in JSONL input.

## Required path

```text
TreePatch + StatePatch JSONL
→ parseJsonlLines
→ projectA2uiSurface
→ ui.component.registry.v1
→ trusted a2ui-surface/1
→ render.a2ui@1
```

## Acceptance

- one generic compiler, no per-view JavaScript surface data;
- Base without Canvas;
- Graph 4 nodes / 3 edges;
- semantic Map 5 nodes / 4 edges;
- Seq 6 nodes / 5 edges;
- malformed JSONL, unknown component, duplicate id, reserved prop and invalid AtlasStage reference reject;
- minimal parser/reducer/projector closure ships in the deterministic Artifact Runtime publication;
- complete normal UI and Artifact Runtime checks pass.

## Boundary

No second renderer, runtime, URL codec, backend, DB, mutable latest, historical mobile-merge input, or Leaflet geography. Git remains source authority; generated publications and URLs remain projections.

Cross-repository deployment and Cloudflare proof are tracked by roccho-dev/adrs#313."}

