- ADRS Issue pagination, writer, canonical ledger, and transport receipt;
- selected feature-repository assertion and receipt freshness;
- generated governance adapter drift;
- GitHub App installation and least-privilege read capacity;
- required-check/ruleset or publish-gate drift;
- CI lifecycle exceptions and expired return conditions.

A canary pass can never satisfy merge admission.

